          "url": "https://artificialanalysis.ai/methodology/intelligence-benchmarking#aa-analyst-agent",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ],
      "note": "公开通用harness及完整提示模板；不是已公开80题完整评测实现。"
    },
    "comparability_warning": {
      "value": "独立榜，不计入 AA Intelligence Index；pass^5 与 pass@1 排名差异显著。",
      "sources": [
